{"description":"4c wygrać chce","image":null,"summary":"We created a demo web app that presents lunar landings in detail. The programme takes into consideration the elevation and stability of the landing surface, as well as the amount of sunlight that reaches the desired location at the time of landing. Based on those variables, the programme tells you the chance of success of the mission. More information on the project is located in the project demo.","details":"<p>The application evaluates landing sites by analyzing surface elevation, terrain stability, and solar illumination at the exact time of arrival. Using these critical factors, it calculates the overall probability of mission success.</p>","dataRefs":[["NASA LOLA","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lro/lola/"],["NASA PDS","https://pds.nasa.gov/"]],"projectRefs":[["Claude AI","https://use.ai/pl?model=sonnet-5&utm_source=bing&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=AI_PL_PL_Chat_DSK_SEA_LLM_Claude&utm_campaign_id=523620264&utm_adgroup=AI_PL_PL_Claude_Exact&utm_adgroup_id=1312819616962928&utm_term=claude+ai&utm_match_type=e&utm_content=&utm_content_id=&utm_funnel=&partner=WM&url=https%3A%2F%2Fuse.ai%2Fpl%3Fmodel%3Dsonnet-5&msclkid=ff16a5b760e91b4f5e07cf4e194e4ae5"],["Background photo for the presentation","https://radio.lublin.pl/2024/04/badacze-wyjasnili-zagadke-odwroconej-geologii-ksiezyca/"],["Web Hosting","https://github.com/"],["Coding tool/viewer","https://codeshack.io/html-viewer/"]],"members":[{"name":"Marcel kochan","country":"Poland","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/1000002324.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":true},{"name":"Piotr Pasieka","country":"Poland","avatar":null,"owner":false},{"name":"Marcin Gąsiorek","country":"Poland","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/Screenshot_2023-07-16-21-36-17-04_3J.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Jakub Kaczmarek","country":"Poland","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/Snapchat-202436